<title>
ATF Cooler Hose Replacement
</title>
<ptxt>
Rubber hoses for ATF cooler should be checked at specified interval. If replacing them, note the following.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
If there is matchmark on each of hose and pipe, install the hose aligning matchmark on hose with matchmark on pipe and then install each clamp in proper position.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Replace clamps at the same time
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Insert hose as far as its limit mark
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Clamp clamps securely
</ptxt>
